  "body": " Born in the Same Month   Ten learners in a group gave the months in which they were born.   Birth Months of Ten Learners   Learner Month Learner Month  Atieno March Faraji June  Baraka June Gathoni August  Chebet June Halima November  Daudi November Imani March  Esther March Jabari October       List , the set of learners in the group born in June.  .    Write as a rule, in the form .  .    List , the learners born in March, and give .  ; .    List the learners in the group born in January.  Nobody: the set is , a set with no elements.      "
