  "body": " Structured Instruction    Suggested Time 8 minutes  Objective To fix the symbols, the words that go with them, and the rules for solving.     Key Takeaways & Teacher Connection   Connecting to Learner Work: learners' answers to part (g) give the difference between and : does the rule allow the boundary value itself?  The word table: at most gives , at least gives , less than and below give , more than and over give .  A filled circle means the number is included; an open circle means it is not.  Solving is like solving an equation, except that multiplying or dividing by a negative number turns the sign round. Check the answer with one value.    "
