  "body": " A Teacher's Payslip   Ms Jeptoo teaches in Eldoret. Her monthly basic pay is Ksh and her allowances are Ksh . Use .     Find her gross pay.  , Ksh .    Her pension contribution of Ksh is taken off before tax. Find her taxable pay.  , Ksh .    Find her PAYE.  Tax ; PAYE .    The other deductions on her payslip total Ksh . Find her net pay.  , Ksh .    Digital: open the PAYE page of the Kenya Revenue Authority website. Are the bands and relief the same as in ? Write down the date you checked.  It depends on the date. If a later Finance Act has changed the figures, learners redo part (c) with the new table.      "
